DESCRIPTION:In partnership with Durham Tech Community College (DTCC)\, thi
 s course prepares participants to be commissioned as a Notary Public for 
 the State of North Carolina and fulfills the mandatory classroom instruct
 ion requirement. The textbook is included at no extra charge. Please brin
 g a current government-issued photo ID with you--federal or State of Nort
 h Carolina.
